    <briefdescription>
<para>Writes to and reads from an SD card through the file system. </para>    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para><simplesect kind="note"><para>This example uses the file system with SD to write to and read from an SD card using Advanced DMA version 2 (ADMA2) in polled mode. To test this example, the file system must not be in read-only mode. To test this example, the USE_MKFS option must be true. <linebreak/>
<linebreak/>
 This example was tested using an SD2.0 card and eMMC (using an eMMC to SD adapter). <linebreak/>
<linebreak/>
 To test with different logical drives, specify the drive number in both the FileName and Path variables. By default, the example uses drive 0 if the FileName variable does not specify a drive number. For example, to test logical drive 1, set FileName = &quot;1:/&lt;file_name&gt;&quot; and Path = &quot;1:/&quot;. Similarly, to test logical drive N, set FileName = &quot;N:/&lt;file_name&gt;&quot; and Path = &quot;N:/&quot;.</para></simplesect>
<preformatted>
 MODIFICATION HISTORY:</preformatted></para><para><preformatted> Ver   Who Date     Changes
